WEBVTT

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:10.915
This video shows how to add a new student on your phone. You will open the students page, fill in the student's details, save, and then find the student in the list.

00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:22.903
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Management, and then choose Students. This page lists every student in your school.

00:00:27.053 --> 00:00:33.221
Tap Add Student. A form opens where you enter the details of the new student.

00:00:34.566 --> 00:00:49.806
First choose the class and section. Then type the student's name. The roll number is suggested for you, so you do not have to work it out. Finally, add the parent's name and phone number, so the school can reach the family.

00:00:54.055 --> 00:01:01.159
Tap Add Student again to save. The form closes, and the new student appears in the list.

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:14.926
To see only one class, tap the class filter. If you have a long list of students to add, you can import them together from an Excel file instead of adding them one by one.

00:01:16.984 --> 00:01:24.664
The student is added and enrolled in the current academic year. You can now mark attendance and record fees for them.
